@startuml
state Ready
state Amount_Entered
state Re_enter_Amount
state Transaction_Verified

[*] -> Ready

Ready --> Amount_Entered : Select Amount

Amount_Entered --> Transaction_Verified : Verify Transaction (Accepted)
Amount_Entered --> Re_enter_Amount : Verify Transaction (Rejected)

Re_enter_Amount --> Amount_Entered : Re-enter New Amount

Transaction_Verified --> [*]
@enduml
